{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32139","headline":"汉皇迎春词 · 温庭筠","name":"汉皇迎春词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春草芊芊晴扫烟，宫城大锦红殷鲜。\n海日初融照仙掌，淮王小队缨铃响。\n猎猎东风焰赤旗，画神金甲葱茏网。\n钜公步辇迎句芒，复道扫尘燕彗长。\n豹尾竿前赵飞燕，柳风吹尽眉间黄。\n碧草含情杏花喜，上林莺啭游丝起。\n宝马摇环万骑归，恩光暗入帘栊里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}